          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جا گرفتن (jâ gereftan) — \"to get a seat; to take up room\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در مترو جا گرفتم و نشستم. Dar metro jâ gereftam va neshastam. In the metro I got a seat and sat down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jâ 'place' + gereftan 'to take'. Barâ-ye kasi jâ gereftan — to save someone a seat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jâ gereftan is built from jâ 'place', inherited from Middle Persian gyāg (EtymDB), and the native verb gereftan 'to take', usually traced to Old Persian grab- 'to seize'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
